 "kind": "answer",
 "message": "Here is what company policy says. Paid time off (POL-PTO-01): Full-time employees accrue 20 days of paid time off per year (1.67 days per month). Up to 5 unused days carry over into the next year; the rest expire on December 31. Interns accrue 1 day per month. Contractors do not accrue PTO. Book PTO in the HR portal; absences of 3 or more consecutive working days need 2 weeks' notice.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-PTO-01"
 ]
}
